  message: "Closed by PR #3560 / commit 29861602b. Audit-findings 0007 ships per-value verdicts for 60 of the 61 Cluster H values (structure deferred to Cluster C / WI-rusit): 53 CANONICAL (top-level constructs in their respective DSLs — doc/template/CSS/HCL/Mermaid/GraphQL/SPARQL/LaTeX/VHDL/Swift/QML/Vue/Svelte/Twig/Handlebars), 0 FOLD (Cluster G already absorbed the scope-qualifier shape), 7 DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD (heading/inductive/theorem/message — dead vocabulary; model — ID-string-only synthetic, prisma.py:120 emits Symbol kind=class while passing kind=model only to ID-construction; external_symbol/unresolved — boundary-pseudo kinds deferred pending parallel Symbol.is_resolved ADR decision mirroring Edge.is_resolved). Cluster D/E shape-leakage hypothesis from handoff notes was refuted at the producer level (signal/entity/event/model are all language-keyword emitters or ID-string-only). Largest single-cluster registry promotion in the ADR-0027 series. Wave 6 of WI-runod is the migration."  # 2354
